On tables,forms,service catalog:
OnLoad()
OnChange()
OnSubmit()
OnCellEdit() -> only works in list view


| Type             | Runs when                              | Common use                           |
| ---------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| **onLoad()**     | Form opens                             | Set/default values, hide/show fields |
| **onChange()**   | A field value changes                  | React to user selections             |
| **onSubmit()**   | User submits/saves the form            | Validate before saving               |
| **onCellEdit()** | A field is edited directly from a list | Validate/control inline list edits   |



